dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "SVG Markers",
  "description": "Maps+ example: SVG markers.",
  "dataSources": {
    "ds_map": {
      "type": "ds.search",
      "name": "Map rows",
      "options": {
        "query": "| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv \n| eval markerType=\"svg\", \nmarkerColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"rgb(66, 134, 244)\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"#f442ee\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"rgb(66, 244, 125)\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"#f49542\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"rgb(150, 0, 0)\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"blue\"),\nextraClasses=case(like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"fa-sm\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"fa-xs\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"fa-sm\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"fa-xs\", 1=1, \"fa-lg\"),\nshadowSize=case(like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"10,26\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"10,26\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"10,26\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"10,26\", 1=1, \"30,46\"),\nshadowAnchor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"17,18\"),\nmarkerSize=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"45,55\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"55,65\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"25,35\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"15,25\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"25,25\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"15,20\", 1=1, \"35,45\"),\nicon=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"exclamation-triangle\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"battery-2\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"gavel\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"building\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"shopping-cart\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"car\", 1=1, \"hand-lizard-o\"),\nlayerDescription=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"exclamation-triangle\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"battery-2\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"gavel\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"building\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"shopping-cart\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"car\", 1=1, \"hand-lizard-o\")\n| eval description = \"<b>\".description.\"</b>\", tooltip=description, clusterGroup=\"default\"\n| table latitude, longitude, description, tooltip, markerColor, icon, clusterGroup, markerType, markerSize, extraClasses, shadowSize, shadowAnchor, layerDescription",
        "queryParameters": {
          "earliest": "-24h@h",
          "latest": "now"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_intro": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "SVG markers give more control over customization. Control the color using any hex or RGB value, marker size, positioning/size of the shadow, positioning of the popup anchor and more!"
      }
    },
    "viz_map": {
      "type": "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus",
      "title": "tooltip, description, markerColor, extraClasses, shadowSize, shadowAnchor, markerSize, icon",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_map"
      },
      "options": {
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.allPopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.animate": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoomDelay": "500",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMaps": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsLabelLanguage": "en-US",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsTileLayer": "CanvasLight",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.cluster": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.contextMenu": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.criticalThreshold": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.defaultHeight": "600",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.disableClusteringAtZoom": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldown": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.fullScreen": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesPosition": "topleft",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesSearch": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesZoomLevel": "12",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapBlur": "15",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapColorGradient": "{\"0.4\":\"blue\",\"0.6\":\"cyan\",\"0.7\":\"lime\",\"0.8\":\"yellow\",\"1\":\"red\"}",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapEnable": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMaxPointIntensity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMinOpacity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapOnly": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapRadius": "25",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControlCollapsed": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLat": "39.50",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLon": "-98.35",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterZoom": "6",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapTile": "http://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxClusterRadius": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxSpiderfySize": "100",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxZoom": "19",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureActiveColor": "#00ff00",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureCompletedColor": "#0066ff",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureIconPosition": "topright",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureLocalization": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryAreaUnit": "acres",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryLengthUnit": "feet",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryAreaUnit": "sqmiles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryLengthUnit": "miles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureTool": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.minZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.multiplePopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathColorList": "#0003F0,#D43C29,darkgreen,0xe2d400,darkred,#23A378",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathRenderer": "svg",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplitInterval": "60",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplits": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.permanentTooltip": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneBgColor": "#B5E28C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneFgColor": "#6ECC39",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeBgColor": "#FD9C73",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeFgColor": "#F18017",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoBgColor": "#F1D357",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoFgColor": "#F0C20C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.refreshInterval": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.scrollWheelZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPathLines": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showProgress": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.singleMarkerMode": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.spiderfyDistanceMultiplier": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.stickyTooltip": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.warningThreshold": "55"
      }
    },
    "viz_teach": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## What this shows\nThe same crime rows drawn as **SVG markers**. Unlike PNG pins, SVG pins take any CSS colour and per-row size, shadow and glyph class.\n\n## The SPL\n```spl\n| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv \n| eval markerType=\"svg\", \nmarkerColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"rgb(66, 134, 244)\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"#f442ee\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"rgb(66, 244, 125)\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"#f49542\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"rgb(150, 0, 0)\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"blue\"),\nextraClasses=case(like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"fa-sm\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"fa-xs\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"fa-sm\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"fa-xs\", 1=1, \"fa-lg\"),\nshadowSize=case(like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"10,26\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"10,26\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"10,26\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"10,26\", 1=1, \"30,46\"),\nshadowAnchor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"17,18\"),\nmarkerSize=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"45,55\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"55,65\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"25,35\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"15,25\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"25,25\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"15,20\", 1=1, \"35,45\"),\nicon=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"exclamation-triangle\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"battery-2\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"gavel\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"building\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"shopping-cart\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"car\", 1=1, \"hand-lizard-o\"),\nlayerDescription=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"exclamation-triangle\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"battery-2\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"gavel\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"building\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"shopping-cart\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"car\", 1=1, \"hand-lizard-o\")\n| eval description = \"<b>\".description.\"</b>\", tooltip=description, clusterGroup=\"default\"\n| table latitude, longitude, description, tooltip, markerColor, icon, clusterGroup, markerType, markerSize, extraClasses, shadowSize, shadowAnchor, layerDescription\n```\n\n## How it works\n1. `inputlookup` loads the rows. The first `eval` sets `markerType=\"svg\"`, a CSS `markerColor` per crime type, an `extraClasses` glyph size, `shadowSize`, `shadowAnchor`, `markerSize`, `icon` and `layerDescription`.\n2. Each field uses `case(like(description, ...))`, so a rule is chosen per crime type; `1=1` is the default.\n3. Second `eval` wraps `description` in `<b>`, copies it to `tooltip` and sets `clusterGroup=\"default\"`.\n4. `table` lists the fields Maps+ reads, in a readable order (order itself does not matter).\n\n## Field formats and rules\n| Field | Expected format | Rule / gotcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| `latitude` | decimal degrees, numeric (e.g. `41.88`) | Exact lowercase name, required on marker rows. Only the first row is checked; if it has no `latitude`+`longitude` the panel shows an error. |\n| `longitude` | decimal degrees, numeric (e.g. `-87.72`) | Exact lowercase name. Longitude is negative west of Greenwich. Rows at 0,0 usually mean missing coordinates. |\n| `markerType` | `svg` | Required here to switch from the default `png`. |\n| `markerColor` | `#RRGGBB`, `0xRRGGBB`, a colour name or `rgb(r, g, b)` | SVG accepts any CSS colour (this query uses hex, `rgb()` and names). |\n| `markerSize` | `\"w,h\"` pixels, e.g. `\"45,55\"` | A single comma-separated string, width first. |\n| `shadowSize / shadowAnchor` | `\"w,h\"` / `\"x,y\"` | `shadowAnchor` of `0,0` hides the shadow on svg markers. This query only sets it for SIMPLE rows. |\n| `extraClasses` | Font Awesome size class, e.g. `fa-sm` | Default is `fa-lg`. Applied to the glyph. |\n| `icon` | Font Awesome name, no `fa-` prefix | e.g. `car`, not `fa-car`. |\n| `tooltip / description` | HTML string | Hover text / click popup, both raw HTML. |\n| `clusterGroup` | any name except `one`, `two`, `three` | Rows with different groups never cluster together. |\n| `layerDescription` | HTML string | Label in the layer control. |\n\n## Try it\n- Replace the SIMPLE colour `\"rgb(66, 134, 244)\"` with `\"#e41a1c\"`.\n- Double the DOMESTIC BATTERY pin by changing its `markerSize` from `\"55,65\"` to `\"80,95\"`.\n\nStudio note: In Dashboard Studio on Maps+ 4.6.9 and earlier the icon font is blocked, so the glyph inside a pin renders as an empty box; colour, tooltip, popup and layers all work. Classic dashboards show the glyph. Studio also passes empty cells as `null`, and Maps+ 4.6.9 treats a present field as set, so rows with no `shadowAnchor` (every crime type except SIMPLE) may not take the default. Give every row a value (e.g. a final `1=1, \"30,30\"` in that `case`) if you see odd shadows. The query is left unchanged here."
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "tabs": {
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "New tab",
          "layoutId": "layout_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "layoutDefinitions": {
      "layout_1": {
        "type": "absolute",
        "options": {
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 850,
          "display": "auto"
        },
        "structure": [
          {
            "item": "viz_intro",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 1440,
              "h": 90
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_map",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 90,
              "w": 880,
              "h": 760
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_teach",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 880,
              "y": 90,
              "w": 560,
              "h": 760
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
